<title>USA: Transcend awarded $6.1 mln in contracts.</title>
<headline>Transcend awarded $6.1 mln in contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transcend Services Inc said on Tuesday that it had signed contracts with two New England Hospitals totaling $6.1 million for the management of the Health Information Management/Medical Records Departments of the hospitals.</p>
<p>Transcend said the contracts, which run over a two-year and a five-year period, guarantee a fixed cost structure.</p>
